3, "confidence": null}, {"text": " explained", "startMs": 54150, "endMs": 54775, "timestampMs": 54462, "confidence": null}, {"text": " in", "startMs": 54775, "endMs": 54925, "timestampMs": 54850, "confidence": null}, {"text": " under", "startMs": 54925, "endMs": 55137, "timestampMs": 55031, "confidence": null}, {"text": " a", "startMs": 55137, "endMs": 55200, "timestampMs": 55168, "confidence": null}, {"text": " minute.", "startMs": 55200, "endMs": 55925, "timestampMs": 55562, "confidence": null}], "captionMode": "word", "scenes": [{"id": "hook", "kind": "hook", "narration": "Most people think an AI agent is just a chatbot with extra steps. It isn't.", "title": "Not a chatbot with extra steps.", "lines": [], "highlight": ["not", "chatbot"], "data": {"strike": ["chatbot"]}, "transition": "current", "cta": null, "leadInMs": 150, "padAfterMs": 350, "minDurationMs": 2500, "startMs": 400, "endMs": 6550, "audioStartMs": 550, "audioEndMs": 6200}, {"id": "loop", "kind": "loop", "narration": "A chatbot answers once. An agent runs a loop: it thinks, it acts, it observes the result, and it thinks again.", "title": "Chatbots answer once. Agents run a loop.", "lines": [], "highlight": ["loop"], "data": {"nodes": ["Think", "Act", "Observe"]}, "transition": "zoomIn", "cta": null, "leadInMs": 150, "padAfterMs": 350, "minDurationMs": 2500, "startMs": 6550, "endMs": 14425, "audioStartMs": 6700, "audioEndMs": 14075}, {"id": "reason", "kind": "reasoning", "narration": "First, it reasons. The model breaks your goal into steps and picks the next one. Find the paper. Read the abstract. Summarize it.", "title": "Step one: reason", "lines": [], "highlight": ["reason"], "data": {"goal": "Summarize the latest paper on agent memory", "steps": ["Find the paper", "Read the abstract", "Summarize it"]}, "transition": "current", "cta": null, "leadInMs": 150, "padAfterMs": 350, "minDurationMs": 2500, "startMs": 14425, "endMs": 23425, "audioStartMs": 14575, "audioEndMs": 23075}, {"id": "tool", "kind": "toolCall", "narration": "Then it acts by calling a tool. It writes a structured request, like search with a query, and a real program runs it and sends the result back.", "title": "Step two: call a tool", "lines": [], "highlight": ["tool"], "data": {"tool": "search", "request": {"query": "agent memory arxiv 2026", "limit": 3}, "response": {"results": 3, "top": "Memory in LLM agents: a survey"}}, "transition": "current", "cta": null, "leadInMs": 150, "padAfterMs": 350, "minDurationMs": 2500, "startMs": 23425, "endMs": 32775, "audioStartMs": 23575, "audioEndMs": 32425}, {"id": "memory", "kind": "memory", "narration": "Every result goes into memory. A scratchpad for this task, and sometimes a vector store it can search again later.", "title": "Step three: remember", "lines": [], "highlight": ["memory"], "data": {"scratchpad": ["goal", "plan", "search result", "abstract"], "vectors": 36}, "transition": "up", "cta": null, "leadInMs": 150, "padAfterMs": 350, "minDurationMs": 2500, "startMs": 32775, "endMs": 40750, "audioStartMs": 32925, "audioEndMs": 40400}, {"id": "workflow", "kind": "workflow", "narration": "Now loop it. Reason, call, observe, remember, until the goal is done. That loop is the whole trick.", "title": "The loop is the whole trick.", "lines": [], "highlight": ["loop"], "data": {"stages": ["Reason", "Call tool", "Observe", "Remember"], "goal": "Done"}, "transition": "zoomOut", "cta": null, "leadInMs": 150, "padAfterMs": 350, "minDurationMs": 2500, "startMs": 40750, "endMs": 47775, "audioStartMs": 40900, "audioEndMs": 47425}, {"id": "payoff", "kind": "payoff", "narration": "So an agent is not a smarter chatbot. It's a model with hands and a memory. Follow for AI explained in under a minute.", "title": "A model with hands and a memory.", "lines": [], "highlight": ["hands", "memory"], "data": {}, "transition": "current", "cta": "Follow for AI explained in a minute", "leadInMs": 150, "padAfterMs": 900, "minDurationMs": 2500, "startMs": 47775, "endMs": 56925, "audioStartMs": 47925, "audioEndMs": 56025}], "caption": "Most people think an AI agent is a chatbot with extra steps. It is a loop: reason, call a tool, observe, remember, repeat. Here is the whole trick in under a minute.", "hashtags": ["#aiagents", "#artificialintelligence", "#machinelearning", "#llm", "#techexplained", "#reelforge"], "sources": ["https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.03629", "https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2023-06-23-agent/"]}, "quality": "draft"}